everything.

761
00:35:04,168 --> 00:35:06,772
Well, this morning
I found out I was wrong.

762
00:35:06,805 --> 00:35:08,973
This is different.

763
00:35:09,007 --> 00:35:12,110
Which one is him?

764
00:35:12,143 --> 00:35:14,180
