a pencil as a cop.

783
00:35:58,757 --> 00:35:59,925
Take a break.

784
00:35:59,958 --> 00:36:02,493
I'll check it.

785
00:36:02,527 --> 00:36:04,228
-You're right.
-MIKE: Someone's testing

786
00:36:04,262 --> 00:36:05,930
-paint colors.
-It wasn't made

787
00:36:05,963 --> 00:36:08,467
by a mountain lion.

788
00:36:08,500 --> 00:36:11,502
That mark was made
by a human hand.

789
00:36:11,535 --> 00:36:13,538
Well, I would agree with you
except for one thing.

790
00:36:13,572 --> 00:36:15,173
-SERVO: You're wrong.
-You tell me

791
00:36:15,207 --> 00:36:18,210
