makes a footprint like that.

792
00:36:19,812 --> 00:36:21,112
Now you get the picture again?

793
00:36:21,145 --> 00:36:23,948
MIKE: You see now
why I patronize you?

794
00:36:23,982 --> 00:36:26,117
When I got that radio call,

795
00:36:26,150 --> 00:36:28,287
I thought someone had made
a real goof.

796
00:36:29,187 --> 00:36:30,355
When I saw Harris...

797
00:36:30,388 --> 00:36:32,023
CROW: I said,
"Hello, Harris."

798
00:36:32,057 --> 00:36:33,692
...I had to believe it.

799
00:36:34,792 --> 00:36:37,863
Harris was killed
by some kind of thing that...

800
00:36:37,897 --> 00:36:39,097
MIKE: That killed him.

801
00:36:39,130 --> 00:36:40,900
...was nearly seven feet tall,

802
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:45,170
