810
00:37:00,318 --> 00:37:02,087
I don't know what kind
of problem it is.

811
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:04,388
CROW: It's hard.
That's all I know.

812
00:37:04,422 --> 00:37:06,392
You're an anthropologist,
Johnny.

813
00:37:07,292 --> 00:37:09,427
I thought, well just maybe...

814
00:37:09,460 --> 00:37:10,795
SERVO: You'd anthropologize.

815
00:37:10,828 --> 00:37:12,765
...you might be able
to help us with this.

816
00:37:12,798 --> 00:37:15,333
Well, I can tell you...

817
00:37:15,367 --> 00:37:17,002
