several million years old.

822
00:37:26,243 --> 00:37:28,780
CROW: You wanna throw in
a verb anywhere, Johnny?

823
00:37:28,813 --> 00:37:30,950
Have your men made
a plastic cast of the track?

824
00:37:30,983 --> 00:37:31,450
MACK: Hmm.

825
00:37:32,818 --> 00:37:34,887
You might get a better answer
