840
00:38:19,497 --> 00:38:22,267
I decided to make
breakfast for us

841
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:23,602
while you hit the showers.

842
00:38:23,635 --> 00:38:25,737
SERVO: I'm gonna make
pink eggs for breakfast

843
00:38:25,770 --> 00:38:27,138
[ Laughing ] whee.

844
00:38:27,172 --> 00:38:28,440
Paul!

845
00:38:29,340 --> 00:38:31,043
Mike:

846
00:38:32,177 --> 00:38:34,345
GENE: I agree
with Professor Salinas.

847
00:38:34,378 --> 00:38:38,117
Your casting here is that
of the left hind foot

848
00:38:38,150 --> 00:38:40,018
of some form of reptile,

849
00:38:40,052 --> 00:38:43,053
some very, very large lizard.

850
00:38:43,087 --> 00:38:45,390
I still can't believe
that there are lizards that big

851
00:38:45,423 --> 00:38:47,792
