for that matter.

852
00:38:47,825 --> 00:38:49,962
Sorry, Capt. McCabe,
you're wrong about that.

853
00:38:49,995 --> 00:38:51,295
CROW: Thanks, Brigham Young.

854
00:38:51,328 --> 00:38:54,565
There is a lizard
we call Varanus komodoensis.

855
00:38:54,598 --> 00:38:56,868
There's some photos of him
over in the paleontology lab.

856
00:38:56,902 --> 00:38:58,903
-CROW: He's a Who.
-Who grows to be all

857
00:38:58,937 --> 00:39:01,105
