860
00:39:05,143 --> 00:39:08,847
Gene, is it possible that
one of these lizards is here?

861
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:11,482
-But somehow...
-I don't think so.

862
00:39:11,515 --> 00:39:13,852
And if there were one
somehow on the loose,

863
00:39:13,885 --> 00:39:16,287
