what you're looking for.

864
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:18,723
The Komodo dragon
walks on four feet.

865
00:39:19,590 --> 00:39:21,425
-This...
-CROW: Scene is dying.

866
00:39:21,458 --> 00:39:23,862
...indicates a lizard
that can walk upright.

867
00:39:23,895 --> 00:39:25,563
Some form of reptile...

868
00:39:25,597 --> 00:39:27,432
-CROW: Yes.
-...closely related

869
00:39:27,465 --> 00:39:30,702
