871
00:39:34,738 --> 00:39:37,877
MIKE: Some describe me
as an ambulatory mound of suet.

872
00:39:37,910 --> 00:39:39,410
Thanks, Johnny.

873
00:39:39,443 --> 00:39:41,513
But how in the hell
am I gonna tell the commissioner

874
00:39:41,547 --> 00:39:44,348
