00:40:06,772 --> 00:40:08,207
SERVO:
Johnny, Johnny Longbone,

883
00:40:08,240 --> 00:40:09,908
Johnny, Johnny Longbone.

884
00:40:09,942 --> 00:40:11,243
It's the Johnny Longbone.

885
00:40:11,277 --> 00:40:13,778
Johnny Longbone theme.

886
00:40:16,448 --> 00:40:18,183
