896
00:40:34,932 --> 00:40:37,102
-I've seen his trophies.
-CROW: In the locker room.

897
00:40:37,135 --> 00:40:39,772
How about a little demonstration
for our camp?

898
00:40:41,473 --> 00:40:43,208
All right.

899
00:40:43,242 --> 00:40:45,443
Come on, Johnny Longbow.

900
00:40:45,477 --> 00:40:47,978
I'd like to see you live up
