00:40:55,053 --> 00:40:57,222
while he was crying
about the garbage.

904
00:41:00,692 --> 00:41:02,260
Johnny made everything himself.

905
00:41:02,293 --> 00:41:03,628
SERVO: His clothes, his car.

906
00:41:03,662 --> 00:41:05,063
Even the arrowheads.

907
00:41:06,030 --> 00:41:07,698
