00:41:13,705 --> 00:41:15,640
-from Galleons.
-Okay, Johnny.

911
00:41:15,673 --> 00:41:17,408
MIKE: Here's some toilet paper.

912
00:41:17,442 --> 00:41:20,078
Now let's really impress
the lady from New York.

913
00:41:21,613 --> 00:41:25,117
