914
00:41:25,150 --> 00:41:26,252
SERVO: Let's share him.

915
00:41:26,285 --> 00:41:27,853
[ Laughs ]

916
00:41:29,587 --> 00:41:31,288
CROW: That's right,
walk in front of me

917
00:41:31,322 --> 00:41:34,092
