circle of fans.

934
00:42:10,160 --> 00:42:12,463
It wasn't until they added
the friendly looking

935
00:42:12,497 --> 00:42:14,232
backup singer that the band

936
00:42:14,265 --> 00:42:15,733
that played California Lady

937
00:42:15,767 --> 00:42:18,703
finally hit it big
with California Lady.

938
00:42:18,737 --> 00:42:20,738
The pressures of success
were huge

939
00:42:20,772 --> 00:42:23,407
and the fish-lipped guy
who took on the public role

940
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:26,010
