948
00:42:39,657 --> 00:42:41,558
and Toots and the Maytals.

949
00:42:41,592 --> 00:42:43,695
Backstage, though,
the fish-lipped guy's

950
00:42:43,728 --> 00:42:46,030
drinking was beginning
to get out of hand.

951
00:42:46,063 --> 00:42:48,967
Creative tensions mounted
and a haze of alcohol

952
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:51,102
served only to cover up
the Eskimo's

953
00:42:51,135 --> 00:42:52,670
increasing drug use.

954
00:42:52,703 --> 00:42:54,905
It was a hopeful sign
when the friendly-looking

955
