backup singer checked
into a rehab clinic

956
00:42:57,575 --> 00:42:59,010
to have her blood replaced

957
00:42:59,043 --> 00:43:01,312
but the fish-lipped guy's
out-of-control

958
00:43:01,345 --> 00:43:03,115
womanizing led the Eskimo

959
00:43:03,148 --> 00:43:04,448
into an ever more deadly

960
00:43:04,482 --> 00:43:06,617
spiral of drug use and drink.

961
00:43:06,650 --> 00:43:09,120
Drug-addled recording sessions
produced the band

962
00:43:09,153 --> 00:43:11,688
that played California Lady's
follow-up album,

963
00:43:11,722 --> 00:43:13,925
the more melodic
Rhode Island Lady,

964
00:43:13,958 --> 00:43:15,760
but it failed
to crack the charts

965
00:43:15,793 --> 00:43:17,828
as the band that played
California Lady's

966
