980
00:43:54,865 --> 00:43:56,500
MAN: Okay. Thank you.
That's a wrap

981
00:43:56,533 --> 00:43:58,370
-and we have movie sign.
-...returned

982
00:43:58,403 --> 00:43:59,470
to the drinking, drugs,

983
00:43:59,503 --> 00:44:01,640
-gambling, womanizing...
-MAN: Mike.

984
00:44:01,673 --> 00:44:03,742
[ Doors opening ]

985
00:44:13,852 --> 00:44:15,487
SERVO: Hey, how'd it go?

986
00:44:15,520 --> 00:44:16,788
